    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Bastion-Shell Plating.</strong> You know how to add just one more layer of “uphill” between your people and incoming harm.</p><ul><li>When you spend at least 10 minutes reinforcing <strong>armor, shields, or fortification surfaces</strong> before an encounter, choose a number of targets equal to your Body modifier (minimum 1).</li><li>Until the next short or a Soma Break, each chosen target gains a +1 bonus to <strong>Guard</strong> against the first attack made against them in each combat, as long as they are using the reinforced gear or within the protected area.</li><li>This doesn’t stack with itself; it just makes the <em>first hit</em> each fight a little more likely to glance off.</li></ul>",
